# GitHub AI Models API Token
# Get your token from: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# Make sure to select the appropriate scopes for GitHub AI models
GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_token_here

### Gemini API Key
# Get your API key from: https://developers.generativeai.google.com/
# Make sure to enable the Gemini API for your project
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
